nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}\">\\(\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bba47d15e357cf58\" href=\"?note=bba47d15e357cf58\" title=\"43-df-pi11random\">43-df-pi11random</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HYP}\">\\(\\mathrm{HYP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5bdf9b99211ed117\" href=\"?note=5bdf9b99211ed117\" title=\"43-df-hyp\">43-df-hyp</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSet}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{AsSet}(X)\\notin\\mathrm{HYP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{AsSet}(X)\\notin\\mathrm{HYP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：若 X 超算术，则其单点集为有效 Δ11 类，从而为 Π11 零类，正被随机性排除。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq